# React Adapter

- React is a peerDependency of `@dndgem/react`.
- Do not bundle React into the library.
- Prefer no misleading public component API (e.g. AdaptiveGrid) before DND-1.7.
- `@dndgem/react` may depend on `@dndgem/core` and `@dndgem/dom`.
- Do not place solver logic in the React package.
